{"id":"mwa4twno-fg246d","at":"2026-11-10T03:30:20.436Z","listId":"v3","label":"Trial: Brotherhood Regalia in, Silent Arbiter out","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot's call 2026-11-10. The pilot reports Iron Man struggles without extra combats and wants hard evasion. Regalia: 'Equipped creature has ward {2}, is an Assassin, and can't be blocked. Equip legendary creature {1}'; Iron Man's combat deploy attaches it free. It replaces Arbiter's offensive job (one blocker per combat, which with Infantry Shield's menace made Iron Man unblockable) without needing Arbiter alive, and the pilot's pods kill Arbiter fast. Without Arbiter, Aggravated Assault's untap lets the whole team attack in every extra combat. Costs: Arbiter's defence (only one creature can attack the pilot each combat) goes while Propaganda is out for the Cosmic Cube trial; menace alone no longer makes Iron Man unblockable. Undo: Silent Arbiter back for Regalia.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Brotherhood Regalia","section":"Equipment (Voltron Payload)","replaces":"Silent Arbiter"},{"op":"remove","name":"Silent Arbiter"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-11-10-0330-v3-trial-brotherhood-regalia-in-silent-arbiter-out.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":35,"nonland":65,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":3.54,"avgMvNonZero":3.54,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"1","creature":1,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"2","creature":6,"noncreature":10},{"mv":"3","creature":3,"noncreature":14},{"mv":"4","creature":5,"noncreature":5},{"mv":"5","creature":0,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"6","creature":0,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"7+","creature":2,"noncreature":4}]},"types":{"creature":17,"instant":7,"sorcery":2,"artifact":49,"enchantment":2,"planeswalker":0,"battle":0,"land":35},"color":{"identity":["U","R"],"pips":{"W":0,"U":21,"B":0,"R":14,"G":0},"sources":{"W":4,"U":28,"B":4,"R":23,"G":4}},"roles":{"sections":{"Commander":1,"Lands":36,"Ramp / Mana Rocks":6,"Cost Reducers":3,"Card Draw / Engines":7,"Tut