{"id":"mwa4u9mt-uxd8xw","at":"2026-11-10T03:30:37.253Z","listId":"v3","label":"Trial: Aggravated Assault in, Memnarch out","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot's call 2026-11-10 (Iron Man struggles without extra combats; Genji Glove was the only one). Aggravated Assault: '{3}{R}{R}: Untap all creatures you control. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. Activate only as a sorcery.' Repeatable; every extra combat is another Iron Man beginning-of-combat free deploy. The 2026-08-25 cut called it win-more because Mjolnir plus Embercleave kill in one hit; the pilot's games say otherwise. LOOP (flagged, chosen-N, inside the pilot's policy): with Regalia making Iron Man unblockable, The Reaver Cleaver (Treasures equal to combat damage) or Sword of Feast and Famine (untap all lands) pays for the next combat on every hit; in practice a win once Iron Man is flipped with Regalia, one of those, Assault and 5 mana. Memnarch was the pilot's cut over Surestrike Trident, whose Unwinding Clock + Brass Squire loop (2026-09-02) the pilot kept. Costs: Memnarch's 8/9 indestructible body and two Myr blockers, its attack draw, and Padeem's most reliable highest-MV artifact. Undo: Memnarch back for Assault.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Aggravated Assault","section":"Board Wipes & Finishers","replaces":"Memnarch, the Warden"},{"op":"remove","name":"Memnarch, the Warden"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-11-10-0330-v3-trial-aggravated-assault-in-memnarch-out.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":35,"nonland":65,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":3.51,"avgMvNonZero":3.51,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"1","creature":1,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"2","creature":6,"noncreature":11},{"mv":"3","creature":3,"noncreature":14},{"mv":"4","creature":4,"noncreature":5},{"mv":"5","creature":0,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"6","creature":0,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"7+","creature":2,"noncreature":4}]},"types":{"creature":1